our enemies are just as skilled! The battlefield is a chaotic dance of harpoons flying from every direction. <strong>Dodge, strategize, and strike at the perfect moment</strong> to take down your opponents before they take down you.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.poster.avif?t=1765210850\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.webm?t=1765210850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/72aa3486fd1982fa1c4749ba0cda2978.mp4?t=1765210850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1<strong>SWIFT MATCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots are getting enhanced rapidly during the battles. <strong>Make every second</strong> count and be the first to unlock robot's full potential. <strong>You've only got 5 minutes</strong>, so master the chaos and <strong>roll over the enemy team</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.poster.avif?t=1765210850\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.webm?t=1765210850\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558770/extras/96f10895b1a89b530fa70b78d7d0495a.mp4?t=1765210850\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd27<strong>CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time outside of battle to customize <